1
00:00:02,916 --> 00:00:04,916
Steward Jeyn is here!

2
00:00:06,541 --> 00:00:07,750
Perfect.

3
00:00:10,041 --> 00:00:11,291
- Steward Jeyn!
- Steward Jeyn!

4
00:00:14,125 --> 00:00:15,791
Who are these people?

5
00:00:15,791 --> 00:00:17,791
Why do they
not kneel before me?

6
00:00:17,791 --> 00:00:22,000
Steward Jeyn, someone has humiliated me.

7
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,125
Who?

8
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:26,875
Daring to insult someone chosen by the Sovereign Sanctum?！

9
00:00:27,416 --> 00:00:30,000
Those two who refused to kneel. Them.

10
00:00:30,875 --> 00:00:32,500
Who are they?

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,916
One is Elowen Morellan, 

12
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:35,666
the
heir of the Morellan family.

13
00:00:35,666 --> 00:00:38,791
The other is Severin Carter, a disowned son

14
00:00:38,791 --> 00:00:40,958
and my former fiancé
who I just dumped.

15
00:00:40,958 --> 00:00:42,458
You just dumped him?

16
00:00:42,458 --> 00:00:44,791
Isn’t this supposed to
be your wedding ceremony?

17
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:45,791
It is.

18
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:48,625
But I changed grooms.

19
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:51,000
This is Redmond Carter,

20
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,708
the new heir of House Carter, my new fiancé.

21
00:00:54,708 --> 00:00:57,791
Livia and I will
serve you faithfully, Steward Jeyn.

22
00:00:59,541 --> 00:01:01,166
The Morellan family?

23
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,250
Correct.

24
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:06,041
The Morellan family may lead the Four Great Families,

25
00:01:06,041 --> 00:01:10,125
but compared to the
Sovereign Sanctum, you are nothing.

26
00:01:11,250 --> 00:01:12,708
Since this is your first offense,

27
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:15,208
kneel and apologize to me now,

28
00:01:15,208 --> 00:01:17,250
and I’ll spare your family.

29
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:18,458
You…

30
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,833
Steward Jeyn, please.

31
00:01:24,166 --> 00:01:28,333
My dear worthless brother, where did all that earlier arrogance go?

32
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,750
One look at Steward
Jeyn and you fold?

33
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,208
Enough.

34
00:01:32,625 --> 00:01:35,791
No need to waste time
on these bottom-feeding insects.

35
00:01:37,125 --> 00:01:38,791
Let’s proceed with the contract.

36
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:44,625
Partnership with the Sovereign Sanctum is what matters.

37
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,166
Of course, Steward Jeyn.

38
00:01:47,166 --> 00:01:49,708
I have one condition.

39
00:01:49,708 --> 00:01:52,625
to teach these insects a lesson.

40
00:01:52,625 --> 00:01:53,375
Don’t worry.

41
00:01:53,375 --> 00:01:56,250
I’ll issue a decree
from the Sovereign Sanctum later.

42
00:01:56,250 --> 00:01:58,166
The Morellan patriarch will crawl to you

43
00:01:58,166 --> 00:01:59,625
and apologize personally.

44
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,708
Thank you, Steward Jeyn.

45
00:02:02,708 --> 00:02:04,291
What happened to all that arrogance?

46
00:02:04,291 --> 00:02:07,000
And you, where did your big talk go?

47
00:02:07,333 --> 00:02:08,166
Just wait.

48
00:02:08,166 --> 00:02:10,083
Once I sign
with the Sovereign Sanctum,

49
00:02:10,083 --> 00:02:11,875
all of Golantis
will answer to me.

50
00:02:12,166 --> 00:02:13,083
You’ll spend the rest of

51
00:02:13,083 --> 00:02:14,708
your life rotting in the mines.

52
00:02:14,708 --> 00:02:16,583
Livia, stop wasting breath on ants.

53
00:02:17,291 --> 00:02:18,916
Sign the contract.

54
00:02:23,708 --> 00:02:25,583
With the Sovereign Sanctum’s support,

55
00:02:25,583 --> 00:02:28,541
the Scott family will
shake all of Golantis!

56
00:02:30,333 --> 00:02:31,625
Don’t bother.

57
00:02:32,625 --> 00:02:35,375
You won’t be signing that contract.
